== Bishop's Opening: Berlin Defence, Greco Gambit ==
=== 3...Nxe4 ===
Black captures the free e-pawn with their knight. White cannot take Black's own e-pawn with [[Chess Opening Theory/1. e4/1...e5/2. Bc4/2...Nf6/3. f4/3...Nxe4/4. fxe5|4. fxe5??]], as after 4...Qh4+! a powerful attack is launched on White's king. White's best move is [[Chess Opening Theory/1. e4/1...e5/2. Bc4/2...Nf6/3. f4/3...Nxe4/4. d3|4. d3]], attacking the knight, and now 4...Qh4+ comes with less attacking power than if 4. fxe5?? were played.

{{ChessFooter}}

