== Bishop's Opening: Berlin Defence, Greco Gambit ==
=== 4. d3 ===
White attacks Black's knight and avoids losing material with the tempting 4. fxe5??. Black can choose to retreat it with [[Chess Opening Theory/1. e4/1...e5/2. Bc4/2...Nf6/3. f4/3...Nxe4/4. d3/4...Nd6|4...Nd6]], or try the same attacking idea if White played 4. fxe5??, [[Chess Opening Theory/1. e4/1...e5/2. Bc4/2...Nf6/3. f4/3...Nxe4/4. d3/4...Qh4+|4...Qh4+]]. However, unlike the fxe5 version, 4...Qh4+ does not win a rook as after 5. g3! Nxg3 6. Nf3! the queen cannot go to e4 to check the White king and then take the rook on h1 with the knight on g3.

